IEEE ICCSE 2026 Template
========================

Conference: 21st International Conference on Computer Science & Education (ICCSE 2026)
Venue:      Óbuda University, Budapest, Hungary
Dates:      July 21-25, 2026
Theme:      AI-driven Educational Digital Innovation for the Belt and Road Initiative (BRI)

Target Track: Invited Session 7 - New Technologies, Methods, and Models in Computer Experiment Teaching
Session Chair:    Li Shanshan (Tsinghua University)
Session Co-chair: Fan Xuesong (Peking University)

Template
--------
Uses standard IEEE Conference template (IEEEtran.cls with [conference] option).
Download from: https://www.ieee.org/conferences/publishing/templates.html

Key format requirements:
  - Paper size: US Letter (8.5" x 11")
  - Columns: Double column
  - Font: Times, 10pt
  - Page limit: 4-6 pages (including figures and references)
  - Citation style: IEEE numbered ([1], [2], ...)
  - Bibliography style: IEEEtran

Submission
----------
  - System: EasyChair (https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=iccse2026)
  - Deadline: May 15, 2026
  - Acceptance: June 15, 2026
  - Camera-ready: July 15, 2026
  - Contact: iccse@outlook.com

Note: This is NOT a blind review. Include author names and affiliations.

The IEEEtran.cls file is NOT bundled here as it ships with standard TeX distributions
(texlive, miktex). If missing, download from CTAN: https://ctan.org/pkg/ieeetran
